        "r": 540.0517877864999,
        "b": 665.207704832033
      },
      "content": "A lockout switch (SW1) on the peripheral PWA indicates the front panel keypad is locked. A memory mapped input port (LOTSW*) reads the switch. The switch serves as a lockout request and software performs the lockout.",
      "section_id": "sec_4_2_1_16",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_auto_263",
      "section_level": 4,
